  "description": "An implementation of the Chatter.MessageBrokers.Reliability adapter library which leverages EF Core for transactions, units of work, inbox and outbox. The inbox row records whether a message id is claimed or handled, so a handler that never completed no longer suppresses its redelivery, and a unit of work that rolls back a transaction it began leaves no tracked change behind it",
